  "id": "imaginary-companion",
  "term": "imaginary companion",
  "definition": "An imaginary companion is an invented person or other imagined being that someone, often a child but sometimes an adult, creates and interacts with in play or imagination. Reports of imaginary companions occur across cultures, although they appear to be described more often in Western countries.",
